    "content": "Halconin käyttö, mutta en ole varma, mitä standardeja kamerallani/-kamerillani tuetaan Valmistaja mainitsee yleensä tukemat standardit nimenomaisesti joko dokumentaatiossa tai dokumentaatiossa tai markkinointimateriaalissa, jossa näkyy USB3 Vision, GigE Vision tai GenICam -logot.\nHere’s an example from Basler: https://www.baslerweb.com/en/products/cameras/area-scan-cameras/scout/sca640-120gc/\nUsually camera manufactures will mention what standards their products conform to, in the below example you can see it supports GenICam and GigE Vision, which is what we want.\nYou can also find more information here:\nDoes your camera support USB3 Vision?\nDoes your camera support GigE Vision?\nLast updated: 2024-06-03 | View on official support site",
