    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst -tuki \u003e Aloittaminen",
    "content": "Johdanto Tämä tuki kattaa Swing Catalyst Home -ohjelman.\nLooking for the getting started guide? Getting Started.\nWhat is the Swing Catalyst Home? The Home is a version of the Swing Catalyst software used aimed towards the home market. It has fewer professional features, such as lack of record lesson functionality and incorporates a user limit.\nHome supports up to two live cameras and a Foresight or FlightScope launch monitor.\nDifferences between Home and Swing Catalyst Pro+ \u0026 Pro Swing Catalyst Home targets the home user, and at a price point that is significantly lower than Swing Catalyst Pro, or Pro+ intended for professional users.\nFunctionality matrix: Edition Drawing Tools Supported Cameras Record Lesson Group Support User Restriction Sensor Plate Support Launch Monitor\nPro+ Yes Up to 4 Yes Yes No Yes\nYes\nPro Yes Up to 2 Yes Yes No No\nYes\nHome Lite Some* 1 Camera No No 5 Users No Foresight Only\nHome Some* Up to 2 No No 5 Users No* Yes\nLite Yes No Yes Yes No No No\nThe new Dual Pressure plates are supported by Home, no other plates are supported in this version. The following drawing tools are available in Home Drawing Tool Type Available in Home\nLine tool Yes\nLine thickness Yes\nCircle tool Yes\nAngle tool Yes\nManaging Subscriptions For subscriptions purchased through our shop, please see:\n../account-setup/cancel-subscription.md\nLast updated: 2024-06-10 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Tämä tuki kattaa Swing Catalyst Homen.",
