    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst -tuki \u003e Ohjelmisto ja ominaisuudet",
    "content": "Johdanto Tämä artikkeli on johdanto Swing Catalyst Onlineen ja sen tarkoituksena on esitellä Swing Catalyst Onlinen työpöytäpuolelta saatavilla oleva toiminnallisuus.\nVaatimukset A valid Swing Catalyst license (What version do I have?)\nA Swing Catalyst Online account\nInternet connectivity\nTable of Contents This guide is split up into different categories \u0026 steps.\nWhat is Online\nOnline viewed from the Swing Catalyst Desktop software\nRecordings, Lessons \u0026 Tour Swings (Desktop)\nWeb interface (Swing Catalyst Online)\nRecordings, Lessons \u0026 Tour Swings (Online)\nUploading a video (Online)\nManaging Storage\nManaging Licenses\nProfile\nWhat is Online Swing Catalyst Online is the connection point which connects the Swing Catalyst Desktop software with the iOS \u0026 Android Apps and can be used for sharing recordings and lessons with other users.\nAll licenses are connected to a Online account.\nViewed from the Swing Catalyst Desktop software This is Swing Catalyst Online viewed from the desktop side of things.\nThe login button can be found on the top of the software in the right corner.\nYour Online credentials are used to log in.\nOne logged in the “Log in” button changes reflecting you are logged in.\nRecordings The Online explorer is separate from the normal Explorer.\nTo download recordings from Online to the desktop software, click a recording and then click “Download”. This will begin downloading the recording and it will end up in the normal Explorer.\nLessons Recorded lessons that are shared to Online or to other Online users can be found here.\nTour Swings Any purchased tour swings will show up in the “Tour Swings” tab.\nSwing Catalyst Online This is Swing Catalyst Online viewed from a web browser.\nLogin screen\nHome screen and Inbox\nExplorer All recordings that have been shared with you or uploaded from the desktop software visible here.\nNote the “share” icon on those recordings which are shared with you from someone else.\nThe orange “plus” button is the “Upload a video” button, where you can upload recordings to your account.\nViewing recording details The video player has support for adjustable playback speed.\nLessons The lessons tab has all of the lessons you’ve uploaded to online, or lessons that have been shared to you.\nYou can share recordings and lessons you have created, i.e. not shared with you.\nUploading a video Recordings can easily be uploaded to Swing Catalyst by pressing the “+” icon in the Explorer.\nDeleting a video To delete a video, click the Explorer tab and then click one of the videos you wish to delete, then click the “Delete” button. Note: Deleting recordings that are shared with others will also remove the recipients access to the video.\nStorage When uploading a recording or lesson to Online, it uses your storage space. 50 Recordings and lessons (total) are free. You can manage your storage quota on this page.\nIf you are having problems uploading recordings, your storage quota may be full, in that case you will have to either purchase a storage upgrade subscription, or delete existing recordings to make room for new ones.\nIf your storage quota is filled up you will be presented with a warning in the Explorer page.\nEditing your profile Viewing your licenses All Swing Catalyst licenses are tied to an Online account. Perhaps you’ve lost your license key? You can log in to Online and view the licenses directly from the “View Licenses” button.\nPlease note that in order to cancel your license this must be done through our shop.\nPlease see our article: How to manage your subscriptions.\nLast updated: 2026-01-14 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Tämä artikkeli on johdanto Swing Catalyst Online -ohjelmaan ja sen tavoitteena on esitellä Swing Catalyst Online -ohjelman työpöytäpuolelta saatavilla olevia toimintoja.",
